  "notes": "# OverCue firmware 0.13.2\n\n- Control stems from a DJM-V10 running the OverCue Stems EQ mixer update: HIGH controls Harmonics, HI MID controls Vocals, and LOW MID controls Drums. LOW keeps its normal EQ function.\n- Match the player's LINK Player No. to its mixer channel and use LINE or DIGITAL input. DJM-A9 Stems EQ remains supported.\n- Keeps support for the latest four-file stems prepared by OverCue Desktop, as well as previously prepared seven-file stems.\n",
